<title>CHINA: Li &amp; Fung interim profit up 26.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Li &amp; Fung interim profit up 26.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   20.5     vs 17.6</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    13.0     vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    127.57   vs 100.89</p>
<p>    Turnover		     5,622.07 vs 5,208.49</p>
<p>    Company name		 Li &amp; Fung Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 3-5</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   September 10</p>
